# Attribution & License Notice

This project is licensed under the MIT License (see LICENSE).

It vendors and modifies code from the following upstream project:

  - **doubao-murmur** (https://github.com/yourname/doubao-murmur)
    MIT License, Copyright (c) original authors

The original protocol parameters, audio capture, credential storage, and
login detection JavaScript were adapted from its Linux port. These remain
under `src/doubao_input/doubao/`, `login/resources/`, and `streaming.py`.
The legacy GTK/WebKit UI and threaded ASR client have been removed.

Project modifications include asyncio streaming with bounded audio queues,
release-tail capture, private atomic credential storage, browser CDP login,
and RMS measurement for the local microphone diagnostic.

The service, trigger, injection, D-Bus tray, packaging, and tests are original
work for this project, subject to the same MIT License.
